    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40860" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισκευ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>repair, restoration</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἱρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.174
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				175
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.311
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἐ. καὶ κατασκευὰς τῶν δημοσίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.17.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>means of
				repairing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.52
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. pl.,
				<i>materials for</i>
			<i>repair</i> or <i>equipment, stores</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέφαντα καὶ μαχαιρῶν λαβὰς καὶ ἄλλας ἐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				27.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορηγίας καὶ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.72.3
			</span></i>.</div>
